    "title": "A Day Has Only 24±1 Hours - PyCon HK",
    "description": "A Day Has Only 24±1 Hours (Miroslav Šedivý) (Germany) is an English session in the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Hong Kong used to switch to the daylight saving time every year to get “one more hour of sleep”, but much more time may have been spent debugging code dealing with the time zones, daylight",
