    "title": "Announcing all sessions of PyCon HK 2020 Spring - PyCon HK",
    "description": "We are delighted to receive over 20 proposals, and 17 of them are accepted. Sessions covers Machine Learning & Data Science, Python essentials, Web & Application and other topics. Half of them will be presented on Friday & Saturday afternoon, and some sessions and unconference sessions will be also presented on Sunday. The full list",
