    "title": "Content Migration with Python - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Content Migration with Python (Brent Deverman) (Hong Kong) is an English session in the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Migrating content from one CMS to Wordpress using Python while preserving SEO and monitoring the top ranking popular content. Using tools such as Google Sheets, Python 3, WordPress REST JSON API. Level: IntermediateLanguage: English Slide: https://github.com/pyconhk/pyconhk-presentations/blob/master/2020spring/Python%20Migration.pdf",
