    "visibleText": "Content Migration with Python - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Content Migration with Python Posted on April 30, 2020 November 6, 2020 Content Migration with Python (Brent Deverman) (Hong Kong) is an English session in the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Migrating content from one CMS to WordPress using Python while preserving SEO and monitoring the top ranking popular content. Using tools such as Google Sheets, Python 3, WordPress REST JSON API. Level: Intermediate Language: English Slide: https://github.com/pyconhk/pyconhk-presentations/blob/master/2020spring/Python%20Migration.pdf Speaker Bio: Brent Deverman Brent is a Full Stack Product manager and Entrepreneur with experience running web teams in DFS, HSBC & CNN. https://github.com/deverman https://www.linkedin.com/in/deverman/ https://twitter.com/bdeverman https://www.deverman.org Session Time in HKT: 7:00 PM on 9 May 2020 Saturday. Session Time in GMT: 11:00 AM on 9 May 2020 Saturday. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← 廣東話香港Python社群聚會 ← Bringing Python Everywhere with GraalVM (Performance and Polyglot Programming)"
