    "title": "Deceptive Security using Python - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Deceptive Security using Python (Gajendra Deshpande) (India) is an English session in the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Imagine you are passing through an unknown street at midnight and you find that some anti-social elements are following you. To save yourself from them you start running and look for a safe place to hide yourself.",
