    "title": "django-scim2: User provisioning at scale - PyCon HK",
    "description": "django-scim2: User provisioning at scale (Paul Logston) (Taiwan) is an English session in the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Today, many large companies do not want to manually add and update their employees' information in the web based services purchased for those employees. Historically, custom APIs have been built to handle automating this provisioning process.",
