    "description": "Good morning, welcome to PyCon HK 2020 Spring. I am Sammy, the conference chair of this conference and the host of Hong Kong Python User Group. Last year it is unfortunate that I made the decision to postpone the PyCon HK. And due to current coronavirus spreading around the world, and PyCon US also moved",
