    "title": "Post event survey of PyCon HK 2020 Spring - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Thanks for your participation at the online PyCon HK 2020 Spring, and thanks for our speakers and hosts this weekend. After this online conference, we will move back to offline, we are going to prepare the next PyCon HK this October, a physical conference. We would like to collect feedbacks from you. Survey: https://forms.gle/fHSgdsAm3d6rAfx59",
