    "title": "The Development Sprint of Online PyCon HK 2020 Spring - PyCon HK",
    "description": "9-10 May 2020 (Saturday-Sunday) are the date of the development sprint at the Online PyCon HK 2020 Spring. Development sprints are a key part of PyCon, and a chance for the contributors to open-source projects to get together face-to-face for up to four days of intensive learning, development and camaraderie. Newbies sit with gurus, go",
