    "visibleText": "2020 Fall - PyCon HK - Page 2 Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Category: 2020 Fall The status of Python community Posted on October 25, 2020 September 18, 2024 Language: EnglishDate & Time: 6 November 2020, Friday 14:00-14:10Speaker: Sammy Fung Sammy is the conference chair of PyCon HK. He is also the president of Open Source Hong Kong, GNOME Asia committee lead and a Mozilla Representative. Website / Blog: https://sammy.hkGitHub: https://github.com/sammyfungTwitter: https://twitter.com/sammyfungLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/sammyfung Read More Ticket – PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on October 22, 2020 November 14, 2020 Tickets for PyCon HK 2020 Fall is on sales now! Multiple promotional offers are available from just Free session recording access to HK$600 Python Fan ticket. 50% of Ticket Income from Python Fan and Supporter Tickets will be donated to the Python Software Foundation (PSF). HK$600 Python Fan ticket includes session ticket, T-shirt and donation… Read More Staff Team – PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on October 14, 2020 November 14, 2020 The staff team list of PyCon HK 2020 Fall is the following. Conference Chair: Sammy Fung.Administration & Social Network: Daisy Maris Fung.Design: Claire Wong.Finance: Haggen So, Pau Wah.Marketing: Fiona Lam, Annie Ho.Program: YK Mak.Proposal Vetting Committee: Gavin Chan, Scotty Kwok, Younggun Kim.Operation: Henry Law, Ken Chiu. (Last Update on 29 October 2020) Read More Schedule – PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on October 14, 2020 July 20, 2025 The tentative schedule of PyCon HK 2020 Fall splits into 3 tracks which are Business track, English and Cantonese Community track. Tickets are now on sales. 6 November, Friday – Business Track 14:00 – 14:10 Welcome Session: The status of the Python community in 2020 (Sammy Fung) 14:10 – 14:40 Sponsored Session: Python is your… Read More Sessions and Tickets of PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on October 12, 2020 November 14, 2020 PyCon HK 2020 Fall is the 6th Python community conference in Hong Kong. The conference share how we use Python to serve the society and community and demonstrates its use-cases for A.I. and other real-world applications. 50% of Ticket Income from Python Fan and Supporter Tickets will be donated to the Python Software Foundation (PSF)…. Read More Call for Proposals – PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on September 11, 2020 November 14, 2020 PyCon HK 2020 Fall calls for both English & Cantonese proposals. It is the 2nd online this year organised by the PyCon Hong Kong committee. A single track is planned for the conference, we expect our speakers to do the live presentation with video conferencing software at the conference. Participants will also meet us on… Read More Previous 1 2 Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! →"
