    "title": "Apache Heron, the stream processing system, in Cybersecurity with Python - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Apache Heron is a new competing stream processing system in the market. Originally developed by Twitter and used for tweet analytics, and later open-sourced to Apache Foundation. Combining with a streaming system for ingress and a database for storage, Apache Heron enables the ability of real-time big data analytic. With the native support of Python,",
