    "title": "Data-rich content management with Django CMS and Django REST Framework - PyCon HK",
    "description": "Oftentimes, company websites are thought of as a single monolithic application. However, as many of you know, websites often host many different applications through a single DNS. We'll do a dive into how Clover balances the intricacies of allowing independent and customizable content management along with complex applications in one single platform using the power",
