    "description": "If you are anything like me, when you started with Python ‘print’ was the debugger of choice. But you likely found that was slow, tedious, and didn’t cut it for more complex problems. Let’s dive into methods for debugging remote python in environments such as Raspberry Pi, Docker containers, remote Linux Servers, and Jupyter Notebooks",
