    "description": "The New generation tooling for MySQL is MySQL Shell. It has SQL, JS and Python language support. Using Python with MySQL Shell allows quick ease of use on CLI with MySQL Server. The session will share the latest usage of MySQL Shell in NoSQL (Collection API) and writing MySQL Shell reports together with Python Script",
