    "visibleText": "Ticket – PyCon HK 2020 Fall - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Ticket – PyCon HK 2020 Fall Posted on October 22, 2020 November 14, 2020 Tickets for PyCon HK 2020 Fall is on sales now! Multiple promotional offers are available from just Free session recording access to HK$600 Python Fan ticket. 50% of Ticket Income from Python Fan and Supporter Tickets will be donated to the Python Software Foundation (PSF). HK$600 Python Fan ticket includes session ticket, T-shirt and donation (50% of ticket price) to the Python Software Foundation (PSF). Student tickets are available for full time students aged under 23. As usual, the Financial Assistance Program is also available for the people who are jobless, local income or any python supporters with other reasons who require financial assistance, free or discounted tickets will be offered to successful applicants. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2020 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Staff Team – PyCon HK 2020 Fall ← The status of Python community"
